      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. Speaking as an LGBTQ user, for many of us, VRChat is a place for safe expression of our gender and sexuality, especially within age restricted spaces. Honestly, that’s beautiful, and should never change. However, there are a lot of places in the world where being LGBTQ simply isn’t safe. Having our government IDs potentially tied back to our VRChat accounts through a data breach would be disastrous. The service they use for age verification is one that’s trusted by many, and claims they don’t store IDs, and I trusted them enough to go through with the verification process, but I know many people who rightfully don’t trust anyone with that information. There should be some sort of alternative for them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
