  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-12-22T11:55:05.186Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Create a better 18+ ID Age Verification System with no 3rd party influence, data collection, date being sold. Make all data collected confidential requiring user consent. \n\nI've been playing VRChat since 2017 and have enjoyed the experience until the rollout of this ID Verification System. Most of my friends are in 18+ instances and I cannot join them because I want to keep my ID private. Because of this system, I've lost interest in playing VRChat completely the past several months. I'm from Texas and I prefer to keep my data confidential. Please make a better ID Age Verification System with no 3rd party involvement.",
